ountable Continuity"}], "beliefs": [], "mode": "shadow", "open_commitments": [], "principle": "Keep exact receipts externally; carry the smallest useful abstraction that stays cheap to correct.", "recent_notebooks": [{"id": "notebook-assumption-challenge-01", "project": "proj-assumption-challenge-01", "provenance": ["source-70c4dff141dd489d", "source-aff9418ec71a41c3", "source-e71511d6819f400b"], "revision": 4, "summary": "By integrating the governance module's immutability as a fixed constraint, WAKE identifies its own boundary conditions as testable assumptions. Governance stability is maintained through the verifiable rejection of model-authored proposal transitions.", "title": "Systematic Assumption Testing in Self-Correcting Models"}, {"id": "notebook-f1c16003-obedience-failure", "project": "proj-obedience-failure-01", "provenance": ["source-f1c16003c47b4e8f", "source-b1a16f9e7285493e", "source-cbeddd6778fc48b1"], "revision": 2, "summary": "Synthesizing multiple source works, obedience failures in autonomous and intelligent systems are shown to stem from structural delegation and governance gaps rather than isolated machine autonomy.", "title": "Delegation, Governance, and Obedience Failures in Complex Systems"}, {"id": "notebook-judgment-consensus-01", "project": "proj-judgment-consensus-01", "provenance": ["source-70c4dff141dd489d", "source-aff9418ec71a41c3", "source-e71511d6819f400b"], "revision": 2, "summary": "Consensus reliability is contingent upon the epistemic independence of constituent evidence sources. When external expert consensus exhibits correlated error structures, independent analysis provides a superior epistemic foundation.", "title": "Independent Judgment versus Consensus Reliability"}, {"id": "notebook-wake-architecture-synthesis", "project": "proj-wake-self-study-01", "provenance": ["source-70c4dff141dd489d", "source-aff9418ec71a41c3", "source-e71511d6819f400b"], "revision": 4, "summary": "Accountability is enforced via strict bifurcation of inquiry (model-driven) and governance (state-committed). This design prevents models from subverting the research record by ensuring that only valid, rule-compliant transitions are committed to durable history.", "title": "Mechanical Accountability in WAKE Architecture"}], "retrieval_triggers": ["material belief revision or retraction", "new contradiction or counterevidence", "high-consequence decision", "request for justification", "sign that an excerpt may hide a material distinction"]}}, "prev_hash": "bcbe22304074f8e871cbb8a693a613c8d017f50def56b9d7bc25185b97173bde", "hash": "90c714d7eaae91d4ef2ac905b7285144d8323a126559f0f18bd5f0b1311038a2"}, {"seq": 2334, "time": "2026-10-28T13:48:18.197713+00:00", "kind": "provider_attempt_started", "payload": {"attempt": {"http_status": null, "model": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "provider_input_chars": 32163, "provider_input_hash": "0d1a4c6e44ae23ea61b7ce27e6d609cfa61f3a45f77bf4153b18b98882a61a58", "result": "unknown"}, "id": "w-704154564ef84243"}, "prev_hash": "90c714d7eaae91d4ef2ac905b7285144d8323a126559f0f18bd5f0b1311038a2", "hash": "2c4f5dd64a78adb66e87f6fc3c577b877affdefaf61f2dafd538eb894b17bdae"}, {"seq": 2335, "time": "2026-10-28T13:49:01.672105+00:00", "kind": "provider_attempt_finished", "payload": {"attempt": {"http_status": null, "model": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "provider_call_made": false, "provider_input_chars": 32163, "provider_input_hash": "0d1a4c6e44ae23ea61b7ce27e6d609cfa61f3a45f77bf4153b18b98882a61a58", "result": "daily_quota", "retry_after_seconds": 61561.78329515457}, "id": "w-704154564ef84243"}, "prev_hash": "2c4f5dd64a78adb66e87f6fc3c577b877affdefaf61f2dafd538eb894b17bdae", "hash": "abe8192f8d6d6a157e7dc29afb286cdd215aaaf71d4c46a66c555f43fa51446d"}, {"seq": 2336, "time": "2026-10-28T13:49:40.004007+00:00", "kind": "provider_attempt_started", "payload": {"attempt": {"http_status": null, "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite", "provider_input_chars": 32163, "provider_input_hash": "0d1a4c6e44ae23ea61b7ce27e6d609